    <string name="text_tap_here_to_show_the_top_bar">Tap the transparent red section to show the action bar again, which disappears when you scroll.\nAfter 5 seconds the bar is also hidden, and to show it again just scroll.</string>
    <string name="text_tap_here_to_show_go_to_dialog">Tap here to show the \"Go to\" panel, so you can quickly go to a specific page.</string>
    <string name="text_tap_here_to_show_menu_panel">Tap here to show the menu panel, so you can turn on or off some options (night light, fullscreen, etc.).</string>
    <string name="text_tap_here_to_add_or_remove_the_current_page_to_bookmarks">Tap (and release) here to add or remove the current page to bookmarks.\nTap and hold ("long tap") here to see all bookmarks saved for the current PDF file.</string>
    <string name="text_scroll_to_show_the_top_bar_again">After 5 seconds the action bar is automatically hidden so it\'s easier to read your document. To restore the action bar, just scroll or tap anywhere.</string>
    <string name="text_swipe_left_to_remove_tap_to_go_to_the_page_bookmarks">Here you have the list of all the bookmarks for the current PDF file.\nYou can see a preview of the page in the left side.\nSwipe left to remove the bookmark, while tap on it to go to the page of the bookmark.</string>

